  "$QUEST_END_NPC_NAME$ cackles with glee! Soon their inventions will become a reality.": "$QUEST_END_NPC_NAME$ 得意地咯咯笑！他们的发明很快就会变成现实。",
  "(H-Hiii…!) T-tremors... w-waves... taller than a Clockworks... (Gulp) A... a deafening noise... Wh-what's going on?!": "（呜呜……！）震……震动……比时钟兽还高的巨浪……（咕噜）一声震耳欲聋的巨响……到……到底发生了什么？！",
