  "(Lycan) Damn it… how did you figure it out? I thought I'd fooled all these clueless cats, thanks to the Scroll of Skrolls our god gave me.": "（狼人）该死……你是怎么发现的？我以为靠着我们神赐予的斯克洛尔卷轴，已经骗过了这些无知的小猫。",
