  "(Seriously…?) You're struggling with just those? Hah… well, I guess you tried. Go on, someone will guide you inside.": "（认真的吗……？）就这你就搞不定了？哈……好吧，至少你试过了。进去吧，会有人给你带路的。",
  "(She carefully flips through the pages, completely fascinated.)": "（她仔细翻阅着书页，完全被迷住了。）",
  "(Smirking) But nothing comes for free, you know! I heard there are all-new monsters, never seen before, over there…": "（得意地笑）不过天下没有免费的午餐！我听说那边有从未见过的新型怪物……",
  "(Wolf howls) What was that? Is someone out there?": "（狼嚎声）那是什么？有人在外面吗？",
  "(takes a more serious but grateful tone)": "（语气变得更加严肃但带着感激）",
