  "*Cackle* Wonderful hahahaha! You can start by releasing the magic chains that bind me to this location. Collect a Corrupted Symbol of Shade from a Violet monster in Darkon 1.": "咯咯笑 太好了哈哈哈！你可以先解除将我束缚在此地的魔法锁链。去达康1从紫色怪物身上收集一个堕落的暗影徽记。",
  "*Hmmph* So you were sent by that man Gothante. Even so, I do not trust you one bit.": "哼，原来是哥桑特派你来的。即便如此，我一点都不信任你。",
  "*Psst* Hey, you! Can you come help an old box like me?": "嘘，嘿，你！能来帮帮一个老箱子吗？",
  "*Reading letter* Hmm... I see. There is a reason he refuses to fight. Elaine had a sister, Hannah, for whom he cared very dearly…": "读信 嗯……我明白了。他拒绝参战是有原因的。伊莱恩有一个妹妹叫汉娜，他非常疼爱她……",
  "*Scoff* What, will you smelt the materials for equipment all on your own?": "嗤，什么，你打算自己一个人熔炼装备材料吗？",
  "*Snarl* We will just have to weather the storm then...": "怒吼 我们只能硬扛这场风暴了……",
  "*Sniff* *Snort* Drico smell a stranger here? What stranger want? *sniff*": "嗅嗅 哧哧 德里科闻到陌生人的味道？陌生人要什么？嗅嗅",
  "*Snort* Well look at that, a Metallurgical Bull Ring! I will need to thank Parine later for sending you to me with this precious trophy.": "哧哧 看看这个，冶金牛环！我得之后谢谢帕琳让你把这个珍贵的战利品带给我。",
  "*sniff*. Hmm...Maybe I change mind If do something for Drico! Tribe need sap of Roach Queen for medicine! *snort* You can collect for Drico?": "嗅嗅 嗯……也许为德里科做点什么我就会改变主意！部落需要蟑螂女王的汁液做药！哧哧 你能为德里科收集吗？",
  "...": "……",
  "...but I... I... need your help…": "……但是我……我……需要你的帮助……",
  "...it looked like some kind of pattern. I could get a close look at it because it was surrounded .": "……看起来像某种图案。我没能近距离观察，因为它被包围着。",
  "...maybe you can also find a cloth piece over there. Would you please go and check?": "……也许你还能在那边找到一块布料。能帮我去看看吗？",
  "...the Purple Magician in this book. History of Hardship. Only it says that the Black Magician and the Magician in Purple are the same person. The same person that fought alongside the heroes in the Hero Wars. That does not make sense.": "……这本书里的紫魔法师。《苦难史》。上面说黑魔法师和紫魔法师是同一个人。就是那个在英雄战争中与英雄们并肩作战的人。这说不通。",
  "...they are the scouts of the army of Iblis. It looks like we may have to work together for a little while longer. Are you willing to help?": "……他们是伊普里斯大军的侦察兵。看来我们可能需要再合作一段时间。你愿意帮忙吗？",
  "...we are in the same boat now. We are in danger together. Would you go through with me to the end?": "……我们现在是同一条船上的人了。我们共处险境。你愿意陪我走到最后吗？",
  "...you should be very, very careful. I am almost sure that the assassins that tried to kill me will come after you.": "……你必须非常非常小心。我几乎可以肯定，那些试图暗杀我的人也会来找你。",
  "3rd Job Change": "三转职业",
  "A Date on Mars!": "火星矿场之约！",
  "A Good Friend Is… 1": "好朋友是……1",
